## 9. Privacy & Data Collection Notice

The author does not, through the Mod or its source code, independently monitor,
collect, harvest, record, sell, or analyze users or their personal information.

The Mod runs locally and uses Steamworks.NET.dll to communicate through
Steam's networking infrastructure. The author does not operate a master
server, external data feed, telemetry service, or other external service for
the Mod.

Steam, Valve Corporation, Steamworks.NET, and other third parties may have
their own data-collection practices, networking services, privacy policies,
licenses, and terms. Nothing in this section is intended to describe,
limit, or make representations regarding those third-party practices.

The Mod can be run entirely offline by switching its configuration to local
play. Note that local/offline play has only been tested on a single local
computer and has not been tested over a LAN connecting multiple computers.

